  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanga. Empowering sustainable livelihoods: Enhancing the reintegration of returnees for long-term prosperity in Iraq. 2023-2026.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to facilitate the sustainable reintegration of returnees to the Kurdish Region of Iraq (KRI) into their communities of return by enabling a supportive environment for their successful and long-term integration. This is, among other things, done through capacity building of government agencies, non-government groups, and other institutions, and business plan training and grants for returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
